 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Running a digital marketing agency means juggling with platforms, a growing list of clients and the constant pressure to manage.",
   "start": 0.06,
   "end": 7.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Magic Bolt AI brings it all into one white label platform with your brand, your domain, and your pricing.",
   "start": 7.56,
   "end": 14.32
  },
  {
   "text": "For every client, manage Google Business Profile, Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, and more from a single dashboard.",
   "start": 14.45,
   "end": 21.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Write one post, schedule it for each channel and everywhere on one content calendar.",
   "start": 21.5,
   "end": 26.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Our AI assistant drafts the post and the review replies for each one.",
   "start": 26.79,
   "end": 30.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Track local rankings on the map, audit Google profiles, and compare every client against their competitors.",
   "start": 31.03,
   "end": 36.92
  },
  {
   "text": "Add magic QR cards and review collection to every client's toolkit and launch instant websites in minutes.",
   "start": 37.01,
   "end": 44.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Then run the agency itself.",
   "start": 44.19,
   "end": 46.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Onboard clients through your own website, create plans, approve subscriptions, send invoices, and email your whole client base all in one agency workspace.",
   "start": 46.25,
   "end": 55.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Your clients log into your brand on your domain at your prices.",
   "start": 56.05,
   "end": 60.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn everyday marketing tasks into scalable services and recurring",
   "start": 60.72,
   "end": 64.87
  },
  {
   "text": "revenue.",
   "start": 65.76,
   "end": 66.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Magic Bolt",
   "start": 66.21,
   "end": 67.53
  },
  {
   "text": "AI, your brand, your platform, your growth.",
   "start": 68.28,
   "end": 72.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Visit magicbolt.ai and build your white label business today.",
   "start": 72.88,
